lines=['# Full-campus ZED X visual map and held-out image-only global localization','', '## What was actually built','', f"- **Type:** {M['map_type']}; not Gaussian splatting, dense TSDF, neural rendering or an optimized SLAM atlas.", f"- Source: `localization_full.bag`, left rectified ZED X **960×600**, registered `32FC1` depth. Map positions use the same 225.52-second **RAW LiDAR-only FAST-LIVO2 trajectory** as `maps/campus_full_lio_226s_20261019/`.", '- Coordinate transform: T_map_camera = T_map_IMU × T_IMU_LiDAR × T_LiDAR_camera. Camera↔LiDAR TF previously reprojection-checked; LiDAR↔IMU/base physical mount still unverified.', f"- {M['source_rgb_messages']} RGB and {M['source_depth_messages']} depth messages present. Mapping exporter processed {M['counts']['exact_rgbd_pairs_selected']} temporally selected matched pairs, wrote **{M['visual_keyframes']} visual keyframes**, covering **{M['map_coverage_sec']:.2f}s**.", f"- ORB descriptors detected across selected keyframes: **{M['sum_raw_orb_observations']:,}** raw observations; **{M['sum_depth_valid_3d_orb_observations']:,}** have finite registered depth within 0.6–25m (about {100*M['sum_depth_valid_3d_orb_observations']/M['sum_raw_orb_observations']:.1f}%). Median 3D features/frame **{M['depth_valid_orb_per_frame']['median']:.0f}**, p95 **{M['depth_valid_orb_per_frame']['p95']:.0f}**, minimum **{M['depth_valid_orb_per_frame']['min']}**.", f"- Total preview points after 18cm voxel filtering: **{M['preview_unique_voxel_points']:,}**. NOT a unique, track-merged real landmark count; map 3D observation list contains repeat visits.", f"- Most depth-supported ORB observations are in the **upper 40%** ({M['upper_image_3d_observations']:,}), whereas the lower 40% holds only **{M['lower_image_3d_observations']:,}**. This suggests upper vegetation/building textures dominate rather than reliable road features.", '', '## Cold, GPS-free visual localization methodology','', '- Holdout camera images alone (no depth required for query): ORB query features → global appearance retrieval using indexed ORB Hamming LSH across **all map keyframes** → top 14 map keyframes → map 3D descriptor to query 2D matching → PnP RANSAC + reprojection and 2D coverage gates → global T_map_camera. No GPS, LiDAR pose prior, query odometry, camera-motion prior, or preselection of geographical region.', '- Tested against three bags **excluded from visual-map construction**. One image every ~2s. Each query is independent; temporal tracking/failsafe is not yet integrated. Numerical PnP confidence supports geometric consistency against the mapped feature points but is NOT evidence of globally surveyed accuracy.', '', '## Observed baseline results','', '| Held-out recording | Images queried | PnP verified | Verification rate | Median geometric inliers | Median reprojection error | Median matching latency |', '|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
