 '- The late segment provides **four consecutive** image-only matches at ~60.1, 61.2, 62.2, 63.3s to visual map keyframes **193–196** with **35, 55, 69, 137** geometric inliers. The 63.3s match has 137/144 tested descriptor pairs as PnP RANSAC inliers against the saved map landmark geometry.',
